    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEAD CHARGE is an Fast-Paced Action 2D Platformer where your health bar is your battery and its constantly draining. Shoot, Melee, and Dash through 8 ultra difficult Zones which reward quick thinking and accurate combat as you assimilate enemies energy into your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAY ALIVE-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DEAD CHARGE you play as LYTE MK-2, a combat robot with an impacted battery, in order to complete your mission the only way to stay charged is by using your Melee Spike or Arm Cannon to destroy enemy robots, and dash through them to collect their energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE the Artifical Island, AI-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After reports of robo-terrorism threatening the human way of life, you're sent as the last resort on a mission to destroy the Artificial Island, a trash heap of discarded and broken droids long abandoned, and seeking revenge. Dash through the civilization they've made in order to make your way to the center of the island, and annihilate it before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REPLAYABLE ZONES-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every zone in Dead Charge has multiple routes, designed to test your skills and achieve faster and faster times, along with collectables unlocking extremely difficult challenge levels that'll put your skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEAD CHARGE is an Fast-Paced Action 2D Platformer where your health bar is your battery and its constantly draining. Shoot, Melee, and Dash through 8 ultra difficult Zones which reward quick thinking and accurate combat as you assimilate enemies energy into your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAY ALIVE-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DEAD CHARGE you play as LYTE MK-2, a combat robot with an impacted battery, in order to complete your mission the only way to stay charged is by using your Melee Spike or Arm Cannon to destroy enemy robots, and dash through them to collect their energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE the Artifical Island, AI-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After reports of robo-terrorism threatening the human way of life, you're sent as the last resort on a mission to destroy the Artificial Island, a trash heap of discarded and broken droids long abandoned, and seeking revenge. Dash through the civilization they've made in order to make your way to the center of the island, and annihilate it before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REPLAYABLE ZONES-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every zone in Dead Charge has multiple routes, designed to test your skills and achieve faster and faster times, along with collectables unlocking extremely difficult challenge levels that'll put your skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
